### Web App Frontend (`mob_forge_app/static/`)

Single-page application with 4 tabs, dark mode, glassmorphism cards, and smooth animations.

---

#### [NEW] [index.html](file:///c:/Users/luale/OneDrive/Documents/MCP/mob_forge_app/static/index.html)

- Tab navigation: **Create** | **Gallery** | **Textures** | **Build Pack**
- **Create tab**: Chat-style input, mob result cards with stats
- **Gallery tab**: Grid of generated mobs with texture preview and actions
- **Textures tab**: Color picker, style selector, live texture preview
- **Build Pack tab**: Select mobs, name pack, download button

---

#### [NEW] [styles.css](file:///c:/Users/luale/OneDrive/Documents/MCP/mob_forge_app/static/styles.css)

- Dark theme with Minecraft-inspired accent colors (emerald green, diamond blue)
- Glassmorphism card effects with backdrop-filter
- CSS animations for loading states, card reveals, tab transitions
- Responsive grid layout
- Google Fonts (Inter/Outfit)

---

#### [NEW] [app.js](file:///c:/Users/luale/OneDrive/Documents/MCP/mob_forge_app/static/app.js)

- Tab routing and state management
- API calls to FastAPI backend
- Dynamic card rendering for mobs
- Texture preview canvas rendering
